{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"I'm hooome."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"I'm home..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Wait."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What...?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>You<STYLE ID="1">, I heard you were involved in solving that case the other day?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah... sort of..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's all?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It all started with an accident 12 years ago where a cherry-blossom viewer died. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Then things went wrong in all kinds of ways, and the Megasawa City case and the </STYLE><STYLE ID="2" RUBY="は">flayed</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">-body case happened. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That's what I heard."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\z50.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>, what's with you all of a sudden?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>You<STYLE ID="1">... don't remember?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　What happened 12 years ago."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"12 years ago... you mean that accident?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>You<STYLE ID="1"> were at the accident scene with me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What!?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, you were 3, so I guess you don't remember..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Why are you bringing this up?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, if you don't remember, that's fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hey... now I want to know..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"There was a sound."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"A sound?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>You<STYLE ID="1"> and I, the two of us, had gone to see the cherry blossoms in Central Park."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Uh-huh..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"When that accident happened, there was a strange sound. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">A sound like a trumpet."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Sorry, I don't remember..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That's all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"I'll go to the convenience store..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>You<STYLE ID="1">... if you don't remember, it can't be helped, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">the one 12 years ago, do you really think it was just an accident?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\絶対何か居る雰囲気のアレ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"It's true there were a lot of witnesses. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But I think almost nobody saw the </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="・・">moment</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> he fell from the tree. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I didn't see it either."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hey, <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>, what's wrong with you today? You're acting weird."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"The Megasawa City case and the </STYLE><STYLE ID="2" RUBY="は">flayed</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">-body case, do you think they were really solved?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What do you mean...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>You<STYLE ID="1"> saw the moment of the accident."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I did...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Right after the accident happened... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">you told me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Told you what...?"<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{}
